"id": "276525354504752", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031532_276525357838085_6991066571000915733_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RqYCJtxfsv4Q7kNvwHpkeOm&_nc_oc=AdoEz0S_-Xg2q7StFdgkU8a3STSb4vL2AdTPZeUL6qZd8Jk8EkWZzzHr-SDaH8pziUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRZ3nxDPiETIrK-YYCUPglqr8HlxkLMxjhD1cO-a38F2A&oe=6B0C6D5C"}, "display_name": "Once Upon a Sea - Eli Raz - The Prophet", "keywords": ["Environmental"], "long_description": "\u201cFor millennia, the Jordan River flowed into the Dead Sea undisturbed. Today the Jordan River is a polluted trickle. Industry and mining drain the lowest place on Earth\u2019s water even more. The Dead Sea decline is triggering a catastrophic movement of underground water. As it moves it dissolves deposits under the region\u2019s shores, leaving behind an ever-growing network of dangerous sinkholes.\"", "short_description": "Once Upon a Sea\u2014Eli Raz\u2014The Prophet offers a stark educational journey into the environmental crisis facing the Dead Sea. You'll explore the region's geological history and understand the devastating impact of industrialization and over-extraction on the Jordan River, which is now a mere trickle. The core gameplay involves navigating the landscape to witness firsthand the consequences of receding water levels, including the proliferation of dangerous sinkholes along the shores. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://blimey.tv/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Blimey", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://blimey.tv/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["DOCUMENTARY_HISTORY